---
---

<section id="process" class="py-16">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-center">How I Work</h2>
    <p class="text-lg text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
      I turn problems into prototypes. While agencies are still scheduling kickoff meetings, you'll have a working demo in your hands.
    </p>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <!-- The Old Way -->
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface-raised)] rounded-lg p-6 border border-[var(--color-surface-border)]">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-text-muted)] mb-3">The typical agency</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">The Old Way</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">3-6 months to launch</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Multiple handoffs between PM, designers, and developers</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">$10-15k+ for a basic website</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">You don't see the product until weeks in</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Scope creep, change orders, surprise invoices</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <svg class="h-5 w-5 text-red-400 mr-3 mt-0.5 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
            <span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Final product often doesn't match what you envisioned</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- How I Work -->
      <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface-raised)] rounded-lg p-6 border border-[var(--color-brand-orange)]/30">
        <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-[var(--color-brand-orange)] mb-3">Working with me</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6">The Pep Tech Way</h3>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-brand-orange)] to-[var(--color-brand-burnt)] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">1</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold mb-1">You tell me about your business</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Fill out the form below with your details and what you need.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-brand-orange)] to-[var(--color-brand-burnt)] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">2</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold mb-1">We meet and agree on a deposit</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">A non-refundable deposit gets the demo started — the amount depends on your project. If you move forward, it applies to your total.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-brand-orange)] to-[var(--color-brand-burnt)] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">3</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold mb-1">I build you a complete demo</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">Within 1-2 weeks, I'll send you a live URL with a working site built specifically for your business.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[var(--color-brand-orange)] to-[var(--color-brand-burnt)] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm font-bold">4</div>
            <div>
              <p class="font-semibold mb-1">We refine it together — live</p>
              <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">We meet for 1 hour and I rapidly prototype your feedback. Virtually or in person in Syracuse.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
